  {
    "name": "inspect_layers",
    "description": "Inspect real data, not the map copy: analysis location, CRS, fields, NoData, bounds, version digest.\n\nUse this before analysis when you need to know where a layer's bytes live, what its native bounds are, or whether it is vector or raster. Inspecting a single layer returns that layer's inspection; omitting `layer` returns the whole workspace plus per-layer errors instead of failing entirely.\n\nArgs:\n    layer: Optional layer id or name.\n",
    "parameters": {
      "properties": {
        "layer": {
          "anyOf": [
